    },
    "version": 44,
    "attachments": [],
    "content": {
      "value": "This page tracks design deliverables required from the design team based on approved business and functional requirements. Phase 1 designs are mostly done by now (June). Phase 2 designs are work in progress and planned to be done by mid-July 2026. We will update **Design Status**, **Accenture Review**, and **Zimmermann Sign-off** in our weekly meetings with the design team.\n\n**How to use this tracker**  \nThis table is organized by functional area where priority is mostly based on the build order. We will add final designs through Figma links in the **Figma Link** column as designs are available, and capture unresolved questions, dependencies, or missing states in **Notes / Open Items**.\n\n| **Prio** | **Epic** | **Component** | **Component Detail** | **Sprint** | **Figma Link** | **Design Status** | **Zimmermann Sign-off** | **Accenture Notes / Open Items** | **Zimmermann Feedback** |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | [Product Detail Page](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-5) | **Images** | Thumbnails, hero image, flatlay/model/video (incl. Vimeo support) | Sprint 1-2 | [Design Workspace – Figma](https://www.figma.com/design/XWz3ItpkSqL45P5IFOnQgB/Design-Workspace?node-id=2262-64596&p=f&t=g8I7NUuCTCi1XfRa-0) | DONEGreen | SIGNED OFFGreen |  | **25-06:** mostly lead with video but option to change that. video, flatlay, then 2-4 images (want to AB test # of images) would like to see design with 4 below the 2 big ones  **30-06:** # of large versus smaller pictures needs to be flexible - needs to work for the product (e.g. runway product may need more images) - logic depends on the # of pictures we have - combination of close ups and zoomed out. Runway has certain logic - and perhaps category on top of that. Pause button on videos |\n| 1 | [Product Detail Page](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-5) | **Image Gallery** | When customer clicks to view more images | Sprint 1-2 |  | DONEGreen | SIGNED OFFGreen |  | **25-06:** version of it with swatches - previously presented by Jojo - Zimm wants to see this again  **30-06:** Remove model wearing copy. Then we can put colors there “also available in” underline selected color, name not needed in gallery). Prefer the full page gallery with bigger images - the color swatches for especially bags relevant. max colors? 6 seems to be most  **01-07:** Circle swatch of the actual fabric + color name appears when hovered  For mobile: remove “1/6” counter of images  **02-07:** Signed off |\n| 1 | [Product Detail Page](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-5) | **Product Info** | Product name, description, breadcrumb navigation, | Sprint 1-2 | [Design Workspace – Figma](https://www.figma.com/design/XWz3ItpkSqL45P5IFOnQgB/Design-Workspace?node-id=2262-64596&p=f&t=g8I7NUuCTCi1XfRa-0) | DONEGreen | SIGNED OFFGreen |  | **30-06:** Model wears…size. and include ‘runs true to size’ text as well  **01-07:** Align the width of model text to the product description on top |\n| 1 | [Product Detail Page](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-5) | **Badges** | Product badges (multi-badge priority, configurable display order); badge states: Campaign, Runway, Exclusive, Online Exclusive, VIC Exclusive | Sprint 1-2 | [Design Workspace – Figma](https://www.figma.com/design/XWz3ItpkSqL45P5IFOnQgB/Design-Workspace?node-id=2262-64596&p=f&t=g8I7NUuCTCi1XfRa-0) | DoneGreen | Signed OFfGreen |  | **01-07:** not loving the dark square around it - maybe the text in the box less dark - text a bit finer, less bold  **02-07:** need a hover state to make it clear its clickable. Outline of the box a little bit heavier |\n| 1 | [Product Detail Page](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-5) | **Colour & Size Selection** | Colour swatches incl. \"also/only available in\" logic, colour swatch hover-preview; size selector with swatch states (available, low stock, greyed/unavailable); | Sprint 1-2 | [Design Workspace – Figma](https://www.figma.com/design/XWz3ItpkSqL45P5IFOnQgB/Design-Workspace?node-id=2262-64596&p=f&t=g8I7NUuCTCi1XfRa-0) | DONEGreen | SIGNED OFFGreen |  |  |\n| 1 | [Product Detail Page](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-5) | **Measmerize** |  |  | [Design Workspace – Figma](https://www.figma.com/design/XWz3ItpkSqL45P5IFOnQgB/Design-Workspace?node-id=2262-64596&p=f&t=g8I7NUuCTCi1XfRa-0) | PENDINGYellow | PendingYellow | Do benchmarking and reskin it but for launch we do like for like | **30-06**: Find your size when hover - shows line.  Dani to consider Measmerize follow up - when they return the recommened size - today it just changes the size on PDP but instead play it back to the client  **01-07:** Move “Find your size” up to align with Size, and then it underlines once you hover over it  Need to A/B Test this to make sure that it’s prominent enough  **07-07:** Dani shared email from Measmerize on advice for find your size |\n| 1 | [Product Detail Page](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-5) | **Price & Stock** | Price display (was/now strikethrough); low stock indicator; DDP/DDU duties messaging | Sprint 1-2 | [Design Workspace – Figma](https://www.figma.com/design/XWz3ItpkSqL45P5IFOnQgB/Design-Workspace?node-id=2262-64596&p=f&t=g8I7NUuCTCi1XfRa-0) | PENDINGYellow | PendingYellow | **23-06:** Was/now price missing from Figma. Can't find low stock indicator. DDP/DDU messaging not found — action on Jasmijn to locate screenshot | **02-07:** Charmaine to put was/now on PDP. Haven’t decided on the color - waiting on Jon to come back on this, need a nice green and red - aesthetic of the store color  **07-07:** color still open |\n| 1 | [Product Detail Page](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-5) | **Primary CTAs** | Add to Bag CTA; product availability states (In Stock, Low Stock, Coming Soon, Back in Soon, Unavailable); Notify Me modal (multi-size select); Find in Boutique slide-out; Wishlist star | Sprint 1-2 | [Design Workspace – Figma](https://www.figma.com/design/XWz3ItpkSqL45P5IFOnQgB/Design-Workspace?node-id=2262-64596&p=f&t=g8I7NUuCTCi1XfRa-0) | PENDINGGreen | SIGNED OFFGreen | **13-07**: Notify me modal misses customer name fields + marketing comms checkbox & success screen - design updated | **25-06:** Not sure on the wishlist icon - park all icons - they are not signed off |\n| 1 | [Product Detail Page](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-5) | **Accordions** | Details, Size & Fit, Care, Shipping & Returns, Environmental Qualities (EU/AGEC) | Sprint 1-2 | [Design Workspace – Figma](https://www.figma.com/design/XWz3ItpkSqL45P5IFOnQgB/Design-Workspace?node-id=2262-64596&p=f&t=g8I7NUuCTCi1XfRa-0) | DONEGreen | PendingYellow |  | **25-06:** client need to interact with size more to reduce returns - we need to make it more intuitive - esp on mobile, users need to know they can click this to get more details (size slide out not signed off)  On mobile - need to make the details & care links shorter - easier to find how to close it. Not convinced of horizontally having to slide the menu  Design team to clean up and then present back to business  **30-06:** put back the plus signs.  Putting the price in product names of material selection, spacing no dash needed. Rename CTA to Explore Option or Shop, something different to View - as it links to another PDP.  Mobile: white space to be consistent, and link should direct to the right tab (e.g. Details & Care). We need to allow for scrolling within this tab - when copy = long  **01-07:** Explore is not the right word - See details is fine  Less opacity when accordion is mapped out so you can still see dress  **02-07:** For mobile: AB test full screen versus partial screen, dev to continue with partial screen.  Opacity a little bit lighter even  Size & Fit and Find my Size are not finalized in this. Body measurements table open. We’re missing for oversize items - separate size table for that - assign the right size table to the right product. Tables should be consistent - so 0P, 0, 1, 2, at the top on both. There are also actual garment measurements (a third table) - missing.  Benchmarking - how companies present those 3 measurements tables  **07-07:** The order of these times should be consistent on PDP and in the slide out. Measurement size tables look good. Widget has been shared to measmerize |\n| 1 | [Product Detail Page](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-5) | **Complete the look** | Shop the Look carousel | Sprint 1-2 | [Design Workspace – Figma](https://www.figma.com/design/XWz3ItpkSqL45P5IFOnQgB/Design-Workspace?node-id=2262-64596&p=f&t=g8I7NUuCTCi1XfRa-0) | DONEGreen | SIGNED OFFGreen |  | **25-06**: like the language “Complete the look” |\n| 1 | [Product Detail Page](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-5) | **More from the edit** | Certain categories we can feature like “Shop more denim” | Sprint 1-2 | [Design Workspace – Figma](https://www.figma.com/design/XWz3ItpkSqL45P5IFOnQgB/Design-Workspace?node-id=2262-64596&p=f&t=g8I7NUuCTCi1XfRa-0) | PENDINGYellow | PENDINGYellow |  | **25-06:** still need this logic from Jojo (visually looks like recommeded for you)  **30-06:** logic needs to come from content / marketing. We want to look at automation for this - prob not for launch - need to see if possible with Einstein - like if you’re looking for Maxi dresses - other maxi dresses display30 |\n| 1 | [Product Detail Page](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-5) | **Recommended for you** | You May Also Like carousel; | Sprint 1-2 | [Design Workspace – Figma](https://www.figma.com/design/XWz3ItpkSqL45P5IFOnQgB/Design-Workspace?node-id=2262-64596&p=f&t=g8I7NUuCTCi1XfRa-0) | PENDINGYellow | PendingYellow |  | **25-06:** need some more rules around it - einstein  One is more based on the browsing behavior of the person or aggregated view of browsing  Need to spend more time on that |\n| 1 | [Product Detail Page](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-5) | **Recently Viewed** | Recently Viewed carousel, on many pages | Sprint 1-2 | [Design Workspace – Figma](https://www.figma.com/design/XWz3ItpkSqL45P5IFOnQgB/Design-Workspace?node-id=2262-64596&p=f&t=g8I7NUuCTCi1XfRa-0) | PENDINGYellow | PENDINGYellow |  | **30-06:** breadcrumb and SEO text - would be.  See full history CTA should be visible if there’s more than one product  2 options: Wishlist/Search Results  What does it look like? Look like the wishlist or like a search page - and then include quick links like save to my wishlist  **07-07:** Full history still pending |\n| 1 | [Product Detail Page](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-5) | **Need Assistance** | Need Assistance component | Sprint 1-2 | [Design Workspace – Figma](https://www.figma.com/design/XWz3ItpkSqL45P5IFOnQgB/Design-Workspace?node-id=2262-64596&p=f&t=g8I7NUuCTCi1XfRa-0) | DONEGreen | PendingYellow | This is supposed to be moved into the accordion section |  |\n| 1 | [Product Detail Page](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-5) | **SEO section** |  |  |  | PENDINGYellow | PendingYellow |  | **07-07:** should we hide this more? Just see the “read more” link initially and only after clicking it, then it expands and you can click open all the sections. |\n| 2 | [PLP](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-6) | **Product Tile** | Image, product name, price (was/now), badge, wishlist star, per-colour variant tiles; hover image vs video; large/featured merchandised tile varian | Sprint 1-2 | [Design Workspace – Figma](https://www.figma.com/design/XWz3ItpkSqL45P5IFOnQgB/Design-Workspace?node-id=240-81&p=f&t=g8I7NUuCTCi1XfRa-0) | PENDINGYellow | PendingYellow | **23-06**: Was/Now in PLP missing — is it same design as mini cart? |  |\n| 2 | [PLP](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-6) | **Quick Add & Wishlist Popovers** | Quick Add to Bag size popover; Wishlist size popover; Model/Item view toggle | Sprint 1-2 | [Design Workspace – Figma](https://www.figma.com/design/XWz3ItpkSqL45P5IFOnQgB/Design-Workspace?node-id=240-81&p=f&t=g8I7NUuCTCi1XfRa-0) | PENDINGYellow | PendingYellow | **26-06:** Missing in Designs  **02-07:** model / item | **30-06:** Hover on product card, get the model view and add little arrows to go through all images.  Bag icon → Cleaner at the bottom, images already have badges  For denim/shoes: there are a lot of sizes, how is it going to fit? shrink - show more sizes on 1 line - currently max 9  Ensure size selection before adding to wish list - for re-engagement journey - does not have to be red errors - nicely displayed  **02-07:** Happy with the sizes. Size required for wishlist. Size list comes up on hover. on hover over size, it’s underline, on click, it becomes a box |\n| 2 | [PLP](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-6) | **Breadcrumb navigation** | Path, e.g. Home / Clothing / Dresses | Sprint 1-2 | [Design Workspace – Figma](https://www.figma.com/design/XWz3ItpkSqL45P5IFOnQgB/Design-Workspace?node-id=240-81&p=f&t=g8I7NUuCTCi1XfRa-0) | PENDINGYellow | PendingYellow | **26-06:** Missing in design |  |\n| 2 | [PLP](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-6) | **Filter, Sort & View More** | Filter/facet panel; applied-filter chips + clear-all; sort dropdown; View More pattern | Sprint 1-2 | [Design Workspace – Figma](https://www.figma.com/design/XWz3ItpkSqL45P5IFOnQgB/Design-Workspace?node-id=240-81&p=f&t=g8I7NUuCTCi1XfRa-0) | PENDINGYellow | PendingYellow |  |  |\n| 2 | [PLP](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-6) | **Editorial & Content Blocks** | Editorial hero image inline in grid; inline subcategory links; editorial/video content blocks within grid; SEO/editorial paragraph with read-more; zero-results page with recommendations | Sprint 1-2 | [Design Workspace – Figma](https://www.figma.com/design/XWz3ItpkSqL45P5IFOnQgB/Design-Workspace?nod